From: okty111 <okty111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:47:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Add GitHub release updater, Tuya cloud reporting and
 zoomable charts

- FusionUpdate: lists releases of a public GitHub repo, picks the highest
  tag <prefix>N (default fusion-vN), downloads fusion-<env>.bin, verifies
  SHA-256 from SHA256SUMS.txt and installs it to the inactive OTA slot.
  Page /fusion/update "Aktualizacja z GitHuba", daily auto-check and a
  sidebar badge when a newer version exists.
- FusionTuya: TuyaLink MQTT over TLS (HMAC-SHA256 signed login), reports
  pv/hoymiles/solaredge/grid power and today/month/total energy.
  Page /fusion/tuya with setup guide.
- Dashboard charts: wheel / pinch zoom, drag pan, +/- and reset buttons,
  double click resets; works for day curve and week/month/year bars.

Co-authored-by: Perplexity <noreply@perplexity.ai>
